# Keys that sign sandbox-ai releases (ssh-keygen ALLOWED SIGNERS format, see RELEASING.md).
#
# A release signs its SHA256SUMS with one of these keys (SHA256SUMS.sig). install.sh and
# `sandbox-ai update` accept a release only when the signature verifies against the keys of the
# tree that is installed now; the new tree's keys count from the next update on. As long as no key
# is listed here, updates are checked against SHA256SUMS only.
#
# One key per line, exactly in this form (scripts/release_key.sh show prints it):
#   release@sandbox-ai namespaces="sandbox-ai-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... [comment]
